<task id="172" project="spaarke-ontology-platform-r1">
  <metadata>
    <title>Pin D-197 "author wins, root included": a rule publish asks the ownership question without a child table, so 194b never refuses a root-homed author</title>
    <phase>11 UAT</phase>
    <gate>startable: uac-r2 194b (R4b-2c, `RestrictedContentOwnerTeam`) is on master as 2cd0f62e2c</gate>
    <status>completed</status>
    <rigor>STANDARD</rigor>
    <rigor-reason>One test and one code comment; no behaviour change. It modifies tests, so code-review and adr-check run.</rigor-reason>
    <model-tier>sonnet</model-tier>
    <model-tier-reason>A pin test over an existing seam; nothing to design.</model-tier-reason>
    <effort>high</effort>
    <deps>uac-r2 194b (2cd0f62e2c)</deps>
    <tags>bff,access,testing</tags>
