  <completion date="2026-10-29">
    Rewritten mid-task: the first version (a 409 for `RestrictedContentOwnerTeamUnresolved`) rested on a wrong premise. uac-r2 corrected itself and the main session verified that `CheckVersionOwnerAsync` names no child table, so 194b never refuses a root-homed author (D-197 holds). The implementer stopped correctly on the escalation trigger first (docs lacked 194b); master was merged into docs (`4470c95b86`, repoint `f1133d951b`).
    Delivered: one comment at the `ResolveOwnerAsync` call and the pin test `Publish_AsksTheResolverWithNoChildTable_SoTheAuthorWins_RootIncluded` (ChildEntityLogicalName null, KeepCreator). Filtered OntologyAdminAuthoring 183/183; mutation (`ChildEntityLogicalName = "sprk_policyversion"`) fails only the pin. Review: main-session read clean; uac-r2 OK at `ddab988203`. PR #2434 merged to docs `fab8c91531`.
    rework: none task 172
